sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Game (Bevy App)
  participant P as NoeticPlugin systems
  participant C as noetic_core
  participant A as Game animation
  G->>P: FixedUpdate (60 Hz)
  P->>P: Sync: clock, world markers, positions → WorldViewCache
  P->>C: Think (agents with think_due, dt = THINK_DT): needs, perceive, memory, fear
  C->>C: threat_branch / choose_activity (agent Rng), effects and SimEvents into its Outbox
  P->>C: Act (every fixed step): run_step, follow_group, fight, leave_mark, locomotion
  C-->>P: Movement → MoveIntent (the game moves the body)
  P->>C: Apply: effects sorted by (source, seq) → apply_effect on each receiver
  C-->>P: SimEvents drained from every Outbox in AgentOrder
  P-->>A: Events: NoeticAnimEvent{entity, event, clip, looping}, NoeticAlarm, NoeticDied
